<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian forces are reported to be moving troops and advisers toward the Saudi Arabia-Yemen border, while Saudi Arabia is hosting 600 Syrian forces amid fighting with the Houthis. A Syrian sailor was killed while smuggling to the Houthis in Yemen, and a Syrian pharmaceutical tycoon was kidnapped in broad daylight in Aleppo. Israeli violations in southern Syria sparked protests, and anti-Druze hate messages have doubled after elections, spread by pro-government accounts. Syrian forces entered the Roj camp ahead of foreign repatriations, and clashes between two families in Aleppo caused deaths and injuries. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOa3lqeTBpUTNQNXM0UnhQY2tEVzJlam9paFdZU2NMR3lIY0dOZndtd29fMzlEYXR2U2VBRHlfQjhoMlNDaUFDTWpmcnBfTm1aaktYUmFraDUzYWN4X0xRWWxRNmd5Y05XWjJhUFdoLThOb1BmLW1kNy1vdE40T1cwVm9lUG1sX0FxWkhRNFhTWEZSWEg1MFhQUURRUFJaam90M1dnUXJJSkNMaUxVakMzUnZqcU4wM05QZTk5QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQZkpNSmxwbUNTc0xzam5CQ0dPY2NuRTF1U05ZTDJaZmhBQnlLR1V0V3JaWkM0NG5oclRzTWRaZXFuS2tLdWstaTFuYUx5cFM3VnRPV2Z2OEpsMUxYeWliaHdBVnN3WTdZbHFqcVg5bVRReUxXZXlSOHpLM1kweERFNHdCVUVwbWJxTDJVb2tJNV9mdXZ6cXczRzdkZy1zZjBGdUY1WlBZRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsBytes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jpost.com/israel-election-2026/article-914218&quot;&gt;jpost.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.therecord.com/news/world/saudi-arabia-turns-to-syria-for-help-as-fighting-with-houthis-escalates/article_a228e406-e4ae-5974-a153-2a7f7c105a46.html&quot;&gt;therecord.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wsbradio.com/news/world/saud